WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.120
Ladies and gentlemen, [intro audio] Would you rather give up your

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:14.160
phone or give up TV? TV. Would you rather start your day early or work

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:24.000
late? Late. Would you rather spend a day skiing or flying? Flying. Would

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.600
you rather have sushi or Indian food for lunch? Sushi. Spectacular.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.640
Give me 14 of them right now. Would you rather have a full schedule

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.160
of implant placements or extractions? Extractions. And the best part

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:44.240
of this plan is no one can stop me. Would you rather have a trip to

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.560
New York or Japan?

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.800
Japan.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.080
What's your favorite instrument? Cowhorn.
